{"id":53142,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-coimbra-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:12:25","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:12:25","slug":"sao-silvestre-coimbra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-coimbra\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra 2026<\/strong> (48\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da *REMAX WHITE S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra*) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, mantendo viva a m\u00edstica de uma das mais antigas e prestigiadas corridas de fim de ano em Portugal. O programa inicia-se \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">15:15<\/strong> com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre<\/strong>, seguindo-se o aquecimento geral \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">18:00<\/strong>, a partida por vagas da corrida principal de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10 km \u00e0s 18:30<\/strong> e o arranque da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 18:31<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ao correres em <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Coimbra<\/strong>, desafias o relevo caracter\u00edstico da cidade dos estudantes entre as margens do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Rio Mondego<\/strong>, a Baixa hist\u00f3rica e a Alta universit\u00e1ria, Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO. Para garantir fluidez m\u00e1xima aos at\u00e9 <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">5.000 participantes<\/strong>, a corrida de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10 km<\/strong> (tempo limite de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">2 horas<\/strong>, at\u00e9 \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">20:30<\/strong>) organiza a partida em tr\u00eas blocos de ritmo: <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Box A (Sub45)<\/strong>, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Box B (Sub55)<\/strong> e <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Box C (+55 min)<\/strong>, mediante comprova\u00e7\u00e3o de marca nos dois primeiros blocos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Escola de Atletismo de Coimbra<\/strong> e pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa Casaense<\/strong>, em parceria com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Coimbra<\/strong> e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Coimbra (ADAC)<\/strong>, a prova oferece camisola t\u00e9cnica de manga comprida, medalha *finisher*, saco de abastecimento rico (\u00e1gua, fruta, bolo e barra energ\u00e9tica), servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro e 1 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita por cada 6 inscritos em equipa. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 