style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/07\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">5\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 22\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">6\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 02\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra (5 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 18:31<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (300 vagas):<\/strong> 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (10\/07 a 12\/07\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/07\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">5\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 22\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">6\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 02\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra (Escal\u00f5es Jovens)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 15:15<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a 48\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026, em Coimbra. A Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre arranca \u00e0s 15:15, o aquecimento geral \u00e9 \u00e0s 18:00, a Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de 10 km parte \u00e0s 18:30 (por vagas) e a Caminhada de 5 km parte \u00e0s 18:31. O tempo limite da prova \u00e9 de 2 horas (encerramento \u00e0s 20:30).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para os 10 km e Caminhada de 5 km (limite de 5.000 inscritos), os valores s\u00e3o: 11,00 \u20ac nas primeiras 300 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es (10 a 12 de julho), 12,50 \u20ac at\u00e9 31 de julho, 13,50 \u20ac at\u00e9 31 de agosto, 14,50 \u20ac at\u00e9 31 de outubro, 15,50 \u20ac at\u00e9 22 de novembro e 17,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 2 de dezembro de 2026. Por cada 6 atletas inscritos em equipa, \u00e9 atribu\u00edda 1 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita. Crian\u00e7as at\u00e9 9 anos t\u00eam inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita na caminhada (sem kit).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no Kit de Atleta e quando pode ser levantado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os inscritos nos 10 km e Caminhada (exceto crian\u00e7as gratuitas at\u00e9 9 anos) recebem camisola t\u00e9cnica de manga comprida, medalha finisher, dorsal personalizado com chip e saco com \u00e1gua, fruta, bolo, barra energ\u00e9tica e brindes. A entrega dos kits decorre na quinta-feira, 10 de dezembro (17:00-20:00), sexta-feira, 11 de dezembro (10:00-20:00) e s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro (10:00-17:00).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam os blocos e caixas de partida nos 10 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida dos 10 km est\u00e1 dividida em tr\u00eas caixas: Box A (Sub45, para tempos <= 45 min), Box B (Sub55, para tempos <= 55 min) e Box C (+55 min). Para aceder \u00e0s Boxes A e B \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio inserir no formul\u00e1rio de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o o link direto para um resultado oficial de 10 km obtido nos \u00faltimos dois anos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro e \u00e9 poss\u00edvel ceder a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro junto \u00e0 partida\/chegada entre as 17:00 e as 20:00, mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do dorsal. Caso n\u00e3o possas participar, podes solicitar a ced\u00eancia formal da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o a outro atleta por escrito at\u00e9 ao dia 29 de novembro de 2026.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Centro Hist\u00f3rico de Coimbra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Escola de Atletismo de Coimbra e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa Casaense\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": []}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70225,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"cl